# C2: mlmf-hf-layout's direct dependencies. Changing this file is a
# deliberate act. Keep sorted -- `deps.rs::direct_dependencies_match_allowlist`
# compares against the manifest's sorted dependency list with `assert_eq!`
# over a VECTOR, not a set, so an entry in the wrong position fails exactly
# as a missing one does.
#
# C4 is why no format crate may ever appear here. This crate parses one
# JSON document into a location map; it knows nothing about GGUF or
# safetensors bytes, and an edge to either would make a layout reader
# usable with one format, which is the composition the two-axis design
# exists to avoid needing.
mlmf-core

# serde_json parses the index. mlmf-safetensors sets the precedent and the
# constraint: the foreign type stays inside the crate, and nothing in a
# public signature names it.
serde_json
